{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15079","headline":"龟负图 · 张佐","name":"龟负图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天意将垂象，神龟出负图。\n五方行有配，八卦义宁孤。\n作瑞旌君德，披文叶帝谟。\n乘流喜得路，逢圣幸存躯。\n莲叶池通泛，桃花水自浮。\n还寻九江去，安肯曳泥途。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}